WEBVTT

00:08.090 --> 00:10.840
<b>Look what I managed to rummage up.</b>

00:10.920 --> 00:13.680
<b>So you wandered around
to get us some food, huh?</b>

00:13.760 --> 00:14.630
<b>Of course!</b>

00:14.720 --> 00:18.430
<b>We haven’t eaten in a long time
and I’m starving!</b>

00:19.220 --> 00:20.890
<b>You know what they say, don’t you?</b>

00:21.430 --> 00:23.730
<b>"Hunger is sharper than the sword!”</b>

00:24.270 --> 00:25.480
<b>They’re not wrong...</b>

00:26.690 --> 00:29.520
<b>Anyway, what makes you think
I’m a Sensitive?</b>

00:31.150 --> 00:32.240
<b>Oh! Delicious!</b>

00:32.320 --> 00:33.190
<b>I know.</b>

00:33.700 --> 00:35.320
<b>Oh, it tastes so good.</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:39.080
<b>I was so hungry!</b>

00:41.660 --> 00:42.580
<b>So...</b>

00:42.660 --> 00:46.420
<b>I think your ability to read memories
is caused by XM.</b>

00:47.500 --> 00:52.840
<b>I used to research how XM unlocked what
we called "Sensitive Abilities" at Hulong.</b>

00:53.720 --> 00:56.430
<b>XM can...
unlock certain people’s innate talents.</b>

00:57.010 --> 00:58.600
<b>And you are one of those people.</b>

00:59.470 --> 01:02.060
<b>So, If I keep using XM, then...</b>

01:02.140 --> 01:04.270
<b>You could enhance your abilities
even further.</b>

01:13.030 --> 01:14.530
<b>Makoto, give me your hand. Please?</b>

01:16.030 --> 01:17.160
<b>Okay.</b>

01:18.620 --> 01:20.660
<b>Out there. See that Portal?</b>

01:21.080 --> 01:23.790
<b>It’s blue. It belongs to the Resistance.</b>

01:24.450 --> 01:27.000
<b>It’s powerful, but not to you
because you’re Enlightened.</b>

01:28.750 --> 01:34.420
<b>Portals are usually blue or green.
Those colors represent two kinds of power.</b>

01:35.260 --> 01:38.220
<b>Blue’s Resistance.
Green’s Enlightened, like you, Makoto.</b>

01:38.800 --> 01:43.520
<b>Control Fields form when Portals connect,
and that Faction’s power grows.</b>

01:44.640 --> 01:48.100
<b>The White Portals are neutral.
Waiting to belong to someone.</b>

01:48.600 --> 01:50.110
<b>What is a Control Field?</b>

01:50.940 --> 01:56.360
<b>It makes XM more powerful within it and
affects minds with that Faction's power.</b>

01:56.440 --> 02:00.530
<b>For Sensitives like us,
we can use Fields to boost our abilities.</b>

02:01.030 --> 02:01.950
<b>Wait!</b>

02:04.240 --> 02:07.040
<b>So that’s how that guy chasing us
could fight like that.</b>

02:09.170 --> 02:10.000
<b>Correct.</b>

02:10.380 --> 02:12.960
<b>But it goes both ways.
The wrong kind of Field</b>

02:13.040 --> 02:16.510
<b>could rob you of your abilities,
leaving you vulnerable.</b>

02:16.590 --> 02:17.420
<b>That’s rough.</b>

02:20.300 --> 02:21.140
<b>Whoops.</b>

02:28.850 --> 02:29.690
<b>Sarah!</b>

02:31.350 --> 02:34.730
<b>Hey! What are you...
Wait! I haven’t finished my lunch yet!</b>

02:41.820 --> 02:44.910
<b>Boarded the train at Shin-Yokohama.
Next stop is in 76 minutes.</b>

02:45.490 --> 02:47.870
<b><i>Secure the target.</i>
<i>Kill the psychic.</i></b>

02:47.950 --> 02:48.790
<b>Sir!</b>

02:50.120 --> 02:50.960
<b>Dammit!</b>

04:40.020 --> 04:41.820
<b>We’ve entered an Enlightened Field!</b>

04:43.610 --> 04:44.700
<b>Use your psychometry!</b>

04:45.200 --> 04:46.700
<b>Psychometry?</b>

04:46.780 --> 04:48.570
<b>Your special ability! Use it now!</b>

04:49.830 --> 04:51.790
<b>-But I don’t...
-Hurry up and do it!</b>

04:52.410 --> 04:53.250
<b>Okay</b>

05:06.630 --> 05:07.590
<b>What did you see?</b>

05:08.050 --> 05:09.760
<b>He’s not alone. This way!</b>

05:14.600 --> 05:15.520
<b>Here! Get in!</b>

05:15.850 --> 05:16.690
<b>The toilet?</b>

05:17.150 --> 05:19.690
<b>You serious?
Isn’t there a better place to hide?</b>

05:19.770 --> 05:21.270
<b>Not in the toilet! Just go.</b>

05:28.360 --> 05:31.160
<b>We have to make a move.
They’ll find us in here.</b>

05:31.240 --> 05:34.120
<b>Just stay quiet, okay?
Everything is gonna be fine.</b>

05:35.250 --> 05:38.080
<b>Trust me. Three guys are headed this way
from car 16.</b>

05:38.790 --> 05:41.040
<b>They are looking for us, just like he is.</b>

05:41.920 --> 05:43.420
<b>Which means that right about now...</b>

06:07.780 --> 06:09.160
<b>You want to get fancy?</b>

06:14.490 --> 06:15.330
<b>Now’s our chance!</b>

06:25.960 --> 06:26.800
<b>Wait!</b>

06:30.130 --> 06:32.180
<b>Now what? There’s nowhere to run!</b>

06:32.760 --> 06:33.600
<b>I got this.</b>

06:35.350 --> 06:36.180
<b>Hold my hand!</b>

06:53.910 --> 06:54.740
<b>It worked!</b>

07:16.100 --> 07:17.310
<b>Borrowing your smart lenses.</b>

07:24.440 --> 07:25.360
<b>Hey, what’s wrong?</b>

07:26.480 --> 07:27.480
<b>Uh. Well...</b>

07:29.740 --> 07:32.280
<b>Normally, I just see memories.</b>

07:32.570 --> 07:34.870
<b>But on the train I could see
those guys coming for us.</b>

07:36.160 --> 07:37.830
<b>XM’s powerful stuff...</b>

07:38.290 --> 07:42.710
<b>That’s your power! You own it.
XM just helps draw it out.</b>

07:44.920 --> 07:46.540
<b>Okay, so what do we do next?</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:51.470
<b>We have no lead. We need Field cover.
It'll help you and hurt him.</b>

07:52.760 --> 07:55.340
<b>Perfect. Looks like there's one
just ahead of us.</b>

08:18.700 --> 08:20.660
<b>-Is this it?
-Yeah.</b>

08:28.130 --> 08:29.670
<b>Such a powerful Portal...</b>

08:30.590 --> 08:34.550
<b>Some ancient Sensitive felt this place
and knew it was special.</b>

08:35.640 --> 08:38.600
<b>So the XM was already here
when they put the shrine up?</b>

08:38.680 --> 08:40.520
<b>XM’s always been around us.</b>

08:41.220 --> 08:45.350
<b>And it’s been exerting its effects
on humanity since the very beginning.</b>

08:46.690 --> 08:51.070
<b>XM contains... ordered data.
A key. A signal.</b>

08:51.150 --> 08:51.980
<b>A signal?</b>

08:52.320 --> 08:55.150
<b>One that touches
and unlocks parts of the brain.</b>

08:55.820 --> 08:58.950
<b>The people most affected by this
are called Sensitives.</b>

09:00.370 --> 09:05.210
<b>Ordinary people can't see or feel it,
but XM is all around us.</b>

09:06.080 --> 09:08.500
<b>The world is so much more
than what it seems.</b>

09:13.710 --> 09:17.090
<b>So... what happened to divide
the two Factions like this?</b>

09:17.180 --> 09:19.600
<b>A mysterious difference in perspective.</b>

09:19.680 --> 09:23.890
<b>The Enlightened feel XM is a way for us
to discover ourselves and our destiny.</b>

09:25.060 --> 09:28.480
<b>They see our relationship with the Portals
as symbiotic. A part of nature.</b>

09:29.480 --> 09:33.030
<b>Part of nature... I could see that, sure.</b>

09:34.440 --> 09:40.530
<b>The Resistance think XM's a threat.
They want to understand and contain it.</b>

09:40.620 --> 09:41.580
<b>Contain it?</b>

09:41.660 --> 09:44.660
<b>They want to use its power,
but only if it can be controlled...</b>

09:45.370 --> 09:47.250
<b>and bent towards humanity’s interests.</b>

09:48.290 --> 09:51.090
<b>A gift or a threat.
Maybe it doesn’t matter.</b>

09:51.880 --> 09:53.630
<b>I don’t know which side is right.
I see both.</b>

09:54.550 --> 09:56.720
<b>Ever since the discovery of XM,</b>

09:56.800 --> 09:59.510
<b>the Factions have been
at constant war with each other.</b>

10:00.720 --> 10:04.720
<b>They fight over these Portals
in order to expand their Faction’s Fields.</b>

10:04.810 --> 10:06.480
<b>So it’s a battle for territory?</b>

10:06.560 --> 10:11.730
<b>More like a battle for minds. The XM in
the Fields influences those it touches.</b>

10:12.570 --> 10:15.190
<b>Whoa. Did those Portals just change?</b>

10:15.280 --> 10:18.820
<b>Yeah. The Enlightened must have
taken them from the Resistance.</b>

10:19.950 --> 10:20.780
<b>Look.</b>

10:21.870 --> 10:23.330
<b>It was probably those two.</b>

10:28.460 --> 10:30.500
<b>Huh. I think I get it now.</b>

10:31.080 --> 10:32.340
<b>We should move... come on.</b>

10:32.960 --> 10:33.960
<b>Are you sure?</b>

10:34.800 --> 10:36.590
<b>They’ll spot us if we take public transit.</b>

10:37.420 --> 10:38.380
<b>I know!</b>

10:50.690 --> 10:51.900
<b>We’ll hitch a ride.</b>

10:53.480 --> 10:54.480
<b>Ok.</b>

10:57.610 --> 10:59.070
<b><i>We lost track of them, sir.</i></b>

11:00.400 --> 11:03.070
<b><i>We see you’re having issues</i>
<i>securing the target.</i></b>

11:04.200 --> 11:05.870
<b>Sorry, sir. Temporary setback.</b>

11:05.950 --> 11:09.910
<b><i>No need to fret, Liu. I understand.</i>
<i>These things happen to everybody... once.</i></b>

11:10.000 --> 11:13.080
<b><i>Respect the gravity of the situation.</i></b>

11:14.500 --> 11:17.510
<b><i>That traitor, Christopher Brandt,</i>
<i>was out ahead of you...</i></b>

11:18.090 --> 11:21.880
<b><i>and was trying to destabilize</i>
<i>the important work we’ve been doing.</i></b>

11:22.260 --> 11:23.090
<b>I’m familiar.</b>

11:23.430 --> 11:27.390
<b><i>Brandt knew how vital Sarah Coppola is.</i>
<i>That’s why he orchestrated her escape.</i></b>

11:27.470 --> 11:29.890
<b><i>Whatever he was doing, it died with him.</i></b>

11:31.520 --> 11:35.190
<b><i>Our plan is already in motion</i>
<i>and it cannot succeed without her.</i></b>

11:37.780 --> 11:40.400
<b><i>And there’s another pressing matter.</i></b>

11:41.490 --> 11:44.320
<b><i>People are starting to talk</i>
<i>about that explosion.</i></b>

11:45.200 --> 11:50.290
<b><i>They're asking troublesome questions</i>
<i>that we cannot afford.</i></b>

11:51.580 --> 11:55.460
<b><i>We expect you’ll take care of that.</i></b>

11:56.790 --> 11:59.000
<b>Right. Consider it done.</b>

11:59.960 --> 12:02.760
<b>I’ll have everything handled in 24 hours.</b>

12:09.890 --> 12:11.270
<b>There’s so many people here!</b>

12:11.350 --> 12:13.390
<b>Must be a popular tourist spot.</b>

12:14.270 --> 12:18.480
<b>Places where XM accumulates
tend to draw in a lot of people.</b>

12:19.110 --> 12:20.780
<b>Some have even become
famous tourist spots.</b>

12:20.860 --> 12:23.030
<b>That would explain it.</b>

12:29.700 --> 12:31.660
<b>Is this really the place?</b>

12:32.710 --> 12:34.080
<b>I’m sure of it.</b>

12:34.170 --> 12:36.580
<b>Hulong’s dirty laundry
is right in front of us.</b>

12:46.590 --> 12:47.430
<b>It’s behind here.</b>

12:54.770 --> 12:55.600
<b>What the...</b>

13:00.190 --> 13:01.610
<b>A hidden path?</b>

13:04.280 --> 13:06.030
<b>Sarah, how’d you know about this?</b>

13:07.490 --> 13:10.370
<b>I see the world differently... remember?</b>

13:19.960 --> 13:23.590
<b>This is the way I’ve seen the world
ever since I was born.</b>

13:25.170 --> 13:28.550
<b>Always seeing XM.
I could see what others couldn’t.</b>

13:29.890 --> 13:33.520
<b>And when I reached out to it,
I’d see visions of far away places.</b>

13:35.480 --> 13:38.350
<b>No one believed me, of course.</b>

13:39.650 --> 13:41.690
<b>My parents and friends
thought I was crazy.</b>

13:45.490 --> 13:46.820
<b>They thought I was crazy too.</b>

13:49.320 --> 13:53.410
<b>I had the power to read memories...
and that didn’t make anyone happy.</b>

13:58.420 --> 14:00.080
<b>They all treated me like a freak.</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:02.840
<b>I ended up alone.</b>

14:04.050 --> 14:07.090
<b>Wishing I could become somebody else.
Anybody.</b>

14:09.260 --> 14:12.260
<b>If you were someone else,
you couldn’t have saved us earlier.</b>

14:15.220 --> 14:17.640
<b>Without your power we wouldn’t have met!</b>

14:33.200 --> 14:34.990
<b>I kinda expected more guards...</b>

14:49.340 --> 14:50.930
<b>What do you see, what is it?</b>

14:51.010 --> 14:51.840
<b>It's red...</b>

14:52.430 --> 14:53.260
<b>What’s red?</b>

15:04.900 --> 15:06.320
<b>Is that a Portal, too?</b>

15:07.030 --> 15:07.860
<b>I think so...</b>

15:13.490 --> 15:14.580
<b>Let’s take a look.</b>

15:16.240 --> 15:17.240
<b>No don’t!</b>

15:23.880 --> 15:24.710
<b>Makoto!</b>

15:38.970 --> 15:40.060
<b>Are you okay?</b>

15:40.310 --> 15:41.520
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

15:42.850 --> 15:44.610
<b>What just happened?
That was... not pleasant.</b>

15:48.820 --> 15:50.820
<b>This place is no ordinary laboratory.</b>

16:12.420 --> 16:15.090
<b>No one’s here...
Do you think they abandoned this place?</b>

16:32.820 --> 16:34.030
<b>Chaotic Matter?</b>

16:34.860 --> 16:37.070
<b>That red stuff from earlier.</b>

16:37.160 --> 16:40.370
<b>When I was working at Hulong,
we called it Dark XM.</b>

16:43.330 --> 16:47.380
<b>The normal XM I showed you
only affects the human psyche.</b>

16:48.090 --> 16:52.300
<b>But Dark XM has powerful
physiological effects, too.</b>

16:55.130 --> 16:57.890
<b>It may provide a person
an explosive burst of power...</b>

16:58.470 --> 16:59.930
<b>but it eats away at their body.</b>

17:00.640 --> 17:02.980
<b>Prolonged exposure is certain death.</b>

17:03.850 --> 17:05.770
<b>Why would anyone use it?</b>

17:13.320 --> 17:14.900
<b>Keep moving. There's nothing here.</b>

17:35.220 --> 17:36.050
<b>Makoto!</b>

17:37.590 --> 17:39.890
<b>They were running experiments on people!</b>

17:42.930 --> 17:44.810
<b>But what in the world for?</b>

17:48.190 --> 17:49.100
<b>Easy now.</b>

17:50.810 --> 17:52.150
<b>I'm just a little bit tired...</b>

17:53.440 --> 17:56.150
<b>But you were right.
There’s something wrong with this place.</b>

18:04.660 --> 18:05.500
<b>Oh wow.</b>

18:05.580 --> 18:07.660
<b>Wait! The servers are still running?</b>

18:08.830 --> 18:11.040
<b>The console should be... here.</b>

18:14.210 --> 18:16.840
<b>It’s no good. I’m locked out.</b>

18:18.300 --> 18:19.180
<b>Let me see.</b>

18:25.560 --> 18:27.100
<b>You’re pushing too hard.</b>

18:27.810 --> 18:32.360
<b>You’ve used your abilities too much today.
You’ll hurt yourself.</b>

18:32.440 --> 18:34.480
<b>It won’t kill me to give it
the ol’ college try.</b>

18:35.480 --> 18:38.150
<b>Besides, it’s not like we’re going
to get into it any other way.</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:53.880
<b>I'll leave the rest up to you.</b>

18:53.960 --> 18:55.130
<b>Good job. Thanks.</b>

19:09.770 --> 19:12.860
<b>What is this?
What’s this research all about?</b>

19:14.150 --> 19:18.280
<b>“Physiological Side-effects
of Controlled Psychological Manipulation.”</b>

19:18.940 --> 19:21.950
<b>Manipulation?
They were studying mind control?</b>

19:22.450 --> 19:25.410
<b>This was the reason
for all the human testing?</b>

19:26.450 --> 19:29.250
<b>So they could... control people?</b>

19:31.790 --> 19:33.170
<b>This is me!</b>

19:35.590 --> 19:37.630
<b>But... why am I on here?</b>

19:41.010 --> 19:41.840
<b>Makoto!</b>

19:43.260 --> 19:44.850
<b>Don’t make me hurt him, Sarah.</b>

19:50.520 --> 19:52.560
<b>Talk to me, and I’ll let him walk.</b>

19:55.230 --> 19:58.610
<b>When this all started, I thought you were
just another target to secure.</b>

19:59.690 --> 20:01.030
<b>I was told to protect you.</b>

20:02.950 --> 20:07.410
<b>But Hulong’s after you, too.
Their orders are to bring you in alive.</b>

20:10.450 --> 20:12.210
<b>So, what makes you so special?</b>

20:14.710 --> 20:18.800
<b>I’m not special. Just trying to,
uncover Hulong’s secrets.</b>

20:19.590 --> 20:21.840
<b>And that... that made me a target!</b>

20:22.380 --> 20:25.680
<b>If they just wanted you silenced,
you’d have a bullet in your head by now.</b>

20:27.800 --> 20:31.770
<b>There's a reason they want you alive.
What’s your connection to them?</b>

20:41.650 --> 20:45.490
<b>Maybe they want to take advantage
of your ability somehow.</b>

20:59.000 --> 20:59.840
<b>Makoto!</b>

21:08.930 --> 21:12.020
<b>I’ve got you right where I want you.
And you’re all out of moves.</b>

21:12.850 --> 21:15.310
<b>Checkmate.</b>

21:19.480 --> 21:22.110
<b>You can’t run away
from your destiny forever...</b>

21:23.070 --> 21:24.030
<b>Sarah.</b>

22:53.990 --> 22:55.990
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
